# Import Map

> Source of truth for module dependencies. No circular imports. `core/` never imports `gui/`.

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    subgraph Core["core/ (business logic)"]
        engine["core/engine.py"]
        password["core/password.py"]
    end
    subgraph Shared["shared/ (cross-cutting)"]
        database["shared/database.py"]
        models["shared/models.py"]
    end
    subgraph Gui["gui/ (UI)"]
        app["gui/app.py"]
        form["gui/credential_form.py"]
        table["gui/credential_table.py"]
        dialog["gui/dialogs.py"]
        strength["gui/password_strength.py"]
        conflict["gui/conflict_dialog.py"]
        ctc["gui/click_to_copy_filter.py"]
        theme["gui/theme.py"]
    end
    main["__main__.py"]

    main --> app
    main --> aethervault_init["aethervault/__init__.py"]
    engine --> aethervault_init
    database --> engine
    database --> models
    app --> engine
    app --> password
    app --> database
    app --> models
    app --> form
    app --> table
    app --> conflict
    app --> dialog
    app --> theme
    form --> models
    form --> ctc
    form --> strength
    table --> models
    table --> theme
    dialog --> password
    dialog --> aethervault_init
    strength --> password
```
